# v03.0: Nothing rate limits the task endpoints

Issue: #33

No route under `src/routes/` counts requests per client, so one client can
exhaust the process for everyone else.

## Outcomes

- [ ] Outcome: a client past 100 requests a minute receives a 429

## Findings

- No limiter, middleware, or request counter anywhere under `src/`.

> Test strategy: unit, send 101 requests from one client and assert the last is refused.
